Z||000002||Ronnie||08-30-2001||10:49 PM||||What year model car is it? If it's pre- 87 , it's mounted right there on the headlight bracket.But they also have an isolation relay mounted on the driverside fenderwell. 87-88 do not have individual headlight relays , but have one main relay mounted down in the drivers side fenderwell area on the inside of the frame.||||reg||6
